211
00:17:45,621 --> 00:17:55,040
an experiment with the so-called railroad post office or RPO on a route from Washington DC to

212
00:17:55,041 --> 00:18:06,140
New York from which mail was sorted and distributed was a great success use of RPOs greatly improved

213
00:18:06,141 --> 00:18:11,840
speed and efficiency of mail delivery by eliminating the need for stops at train depots along the line

214
00:18:11,841 --> 00:18:13,580
